// REQUIRES: long, host-linux-amd64 || host-linux-arm64
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-ir-flags.py --gopp %gopp --root %S --jobs 8 --cabi 1:30 --cabi 2:30 --cabi 101:100
// P04.13 (D4.8): the IR of every program of the run corpus and of the C ABI
// programs of run-opt-matrix.py's --cabi seeds (P04.11), on both targets,
// as the code generator writes it, has no `nsw`, `nuw`, `exact`, `nneg`,
// `disjoint`, `samesign` and no fast-math flag (`contract` included). That is
// what lets every pipeline give Go's answer: an optimizer can use only what
// the IR promises. unit CodeGen: Pipeline.* checks the scan itself on both
// sides.
